2 CONT -------------------- Rabbi in Opatow (  50´48´´18´´´N; 21´25´´29´´ E ) Possessed like his esteemed forebears an outstanding understanding of the Talmud. He was known as Rabbi Berisch Sifte Kohens (The lips of Kohen) iv 28.
