2 CONT
2 CONT On his tombstone is written the Hebrew date of death on Wednesday Cheshon 1889, which is 10/29/1889
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Meir Landau's father was Jospeh Landau, according to the [https://www.ics.uci.edu/~dan/genealogy/Krakow/family.html Krakau early family trees website] his father Joseph was not a son of R' Yechezkel Landau ("Nodah Beyehuda"), also
2 CONC  there is no source that R' Yechezkel Landau had a son Joseph.
2 CONT Also according to the Geni tree Hamagid Ha'Mefursam R' Yosef Landau died in February 23, 1806, that is long before Meir Landau was born.
2 CONT The Krakau early family trees website suggests alternate ancestors line of Joseph Landau which I added to a seperate Geni tree: https://www.geni.com/people/Joseph-Landau/6000000227122837830
2 CONT I recommand not to merge the two Joseph Landay untill Geni curators will disconnect Hamagid Ha'Mefursam R' Yosef Landau from his wrong parents or dissconect his children from their wrong father.
