1 NAME Wolf Löw /Berlin/
2 GIVN Wolf Löw
2 SURN Berlin
2 _MARNM Berlin
2 NICK Wolf Loeb Berliner
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 AUG 1761
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fürth
3 STAE Bavaria
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 JUN 1828
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fürth
3 STAE Bavaria
3 CTRY Germany
1 OCCU Spiegelglasfabrikant
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Links
2 CONT * http://trees.ancestry.com/tree/26708808/person/2059134366
2 CONT
2 CONT "Wolf was a businessman, but I do not know, in which business he was engaged.  He was also a member of the Board of Deputies of the Jewish Congregation Fürth.  In Löwenstein "Zur Geschichte der Juden in Fürth", published in 1909, 
2 CONC it is mentioned that the sold to the publisher David Zirndorf the talmud of his father Loew Meir Berlin so that the printer could use the glosses for the new edition of the talmud to be published in 1829 and 1832."
2 CONT
2 CONT --  from a private family history by John Joseph Thal (Wolf Berlin's great great grandson)
