1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Salomon Bondy and his first wife, Elisabeth (Karpeles) Bondy, were divorced on 13 February 1864.  Four months later, on 12 June 1864, Salomon married his second wife, Helene Forchheimer, age 24.  By Elisabeth, he w
2 CONC as the father of four children (Alfred, Therese, Malvine, and Leonhard), and by Helene, he was the father of eight more children (Selma, Richard, Oskar, Alice, Ottilie, Gisela, Julius, and Valerie).  Salomon Bondy died in Prague o
2 CONC n 3 June 1904, age 76 years.
