2 CONT Gustav Porges von Portheim born in Smichov near Prag/Bohemia. He ∆ March 8, 1916 also in Smichov.
2 CONT        oo June 10, 1855 in Brunswick, Germany (Braunschweig)
2 CONT
2 CONT see oo record in Loket (Elbogen):  LOKET 1075	O 1840-1849, 1855, 1858, 1864-1867, 1872,1874-1890 page 8
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000141135682073
2 CONT
2 CONT to Mathilda Tolze born Philipp was * August 22, 1831 in Glückstadt/Schleswig-Holstein/Germany She ∆ August 27, 1909 in Smichov near Prag/Bohemia Her parents:  Abraham Philipp * 1788, ∆ August 10, 1842 in Glückstadt/Schleswig-Holst
2 CONC ein/Germany
2 CONT                      Rosa Philip * 1806 in Karlskrona/Sweden, ∆  1866 in Hamburg/Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT             a)  Ottilie born in Smichov near Prag/Bohemia, oo March 10, 1885 in Smichov near Prag
2 CONT                to Jacob Caro * February 2, 1835 in Gnesen/Posen, ∆ December 10, 1904 in Breslau now Wroclaw/Poland
2 CONT                He was a Prof. Dr. see website wikipedia  http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_Caro
2 CONT
2 CONT                   Child:  Edith Caro * June 4, 1888 place unknown, missing in concentration camp Auschwitz
2 CONT
2 CONT             b) Anna born in Smichov near Prag, death in Vienna/Austria burial March 1, 1936 Zentralfriedhof  I. Tor, Group 7,Range 4, Grave 44,  
2 CONT     oo December 16, 1888 to David Albahary * November 11, 1850 in Silistra / Turkey, ∆ July 5, 1905 Bad Ischl/Oberösterreich/Gmünden/Austria,
2 CONT     burial  July  9, 1905 in Vienna Zentralfriedhof  I. Tor, Group 7,Range 4, Grave 44,  
2 CONT
2 CONT                         Child:  1) Felix Isak, * November 25, 1889 in Vienna/Austria, ∆ January 22, 1890 in Vienna/Austria
2 CONT                                   2) Otto * January 13, 1890 in Vienna, ∆ November 30, 1942 concentration camp Theresienstadt
2 CONT                                   3) Dora * November10, 1891 in Vienna, not more information
2 CONT                                   4) Franziska * July 6, 1895 Weikersdorf am Steinfelde/Niederösterreich/Wiener Neustadt-Land/Austria, live 1938 in Vienna,
2 CONT   not more information
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Franz  * Smichov near Prag, Burial:June14,1906 in Vienna  Zentralfriedhof  I. Tor, Group 51, Range 11, Grave 41,   spouse Emilie * August 11,     
2 CONT     1868 Smichov near Prag,8 Smichov near Prag,  ∆  January 4, 1938 Burial: January 28, 1938 in Vienna  Zentralfriedhof, I. Tor, Group 51, Range 11,   
2 CONT     Grave 41
2 CONT
2 CONT             Child:  Lilly oo to Hans Wolf in Vienna/Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT d) Emma * in Smichov near Prag/Bohemia, I have as place of marriage Smichov near Prag, not Vienna!, death place and date unknown, husband   
2 CONT     Ludwig Lazarus Landau * Krakow/Poland, ∆ Vienna, burial: February 3, 1922 Zentralfriedhof  I. Tor  Group 51, Range 9, Grave 44
2 CONT
2 CONT             Child: Alice * July 7, 1894 in Vienna, ∆ January 23, 1943 concentration camp Auschwitz, oo unknown to Max Heuberger * January 31,
2 CONT                       1890 in Vienna, ∆ January 23, 1943 concentration camp Auschwitz,
2 CONT
